Main_Clean.jl
main.jl

# HANDOFF.md — SNAPSHOT-ONLY (decided 2026-08-18).
#
# Ignored here so it never appears in the repo's file tree, but deliberately committed
# as a point-in-time snapshot and then removed again, so every version stays in git
# history and remains recoverable. Use the helper, which does both commits for you:
#
#     powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts\snapshot_handoff.ps1
#
# Committing it by hand needs `git add -f HANDOFF.md` — this ignore rule is what stops
# it being committed by accident, and that is intentional.
#
# *** THIS DOES NOT MAKE IT PRIVATE. *** The repo is PUBLIC, so every snapshot is
# readable by anyone who opens the commit history, including the mentor. The file is
# out of the working tree, not out of sight. Do not put anything in HANDOFF.md you
# would not publish — unpublished results, candid assessments of collaborators, or
# credentials belong somewhere else entirely.
HANDOFF.md

# NOTE: results/ — including results/params/*.jld parameter snapshots — IS
# tracked on purpose. It is the committed quantitative evidence (metric CSVs +
# trained-network snapshots) that backs the reported figures.

